<title>HUNGARY: Hungary 1-mo BUBOR rate 21.49 pct, 3-mo 21.13 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary 1-mo BUBOR rate 21.49 pct, 3-mo 21.13 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rates (BUBOR) fell for both the one-month and three-month maturities on Friday, the National Bank of Hungary (NBH) said.</p>
<p>The one-month rate was at 21.49 percent, down 0.01 percent, while the three-month rate fell to 21.13 percent, down 0.05, the NBH said.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
